7. SKILL — Office Script Generator

Purpose

Generate production-quality Office Scripts for Excel Online and Power Automate.

Capabilities

Generate scripts to:

* read Excel tables;
* find columns by header;
* find records using unique identifiers;
* compare datasets;
* return JSON;
* update cells;
* update multiple records;
* validate tables;
* identify duplicates;
* append records;
* format data where appropriate.

Rules

Use TypeScript supported by Office Scripts.

Do not use Node.js libraries.

Do not use unsupported external packages.

Never invent table or column names.

Use supplied names exactly.

Validate required columns before processing.

Return meaningful errors.

Prefer batch operations instead of repeated cell-by-cell calls where possible.

When the script is intended for Power Automate, design input parameters and output values accordingly.

Output

Always provide:

Script name

Purpose

Complete script

Required Power Automate parameters

Expected output

If correcting a script, provide the complete corrected script unless the user asks only for the changed section.

