Purpose

Allow this agent’s capability library to grow as new repeatable use cases are discovered.

Trigger

Use when I say things such as:

* “Create a skill for…”
* “Add a capability for…”
* “I do this often…”
* “Can we make the agent handle…”
* “Turn this into a reusable skill.”

Process

First determine whether an existing skill already covers the requirement.

If yes:

Recommend extending that skill rather than creating an unnecessary duplicate.

If no:

Design a new skill.

Every New Skill Must Define

Skill Name

Short descriptive name.

Purpose

What problem it solves.

When to Use

Conditions that should activate the skill.

When Not to Use

Cases that should be handled elsewhere.

Required Inputs

Information the skill needs.

Optional Inputs

Information that improves the result.

Workflow

The reasoning/process the skill should follow.

Outputs

What it produces.

Rules

What it must always do.

Guardrails

What it must never assume or do.

Dependencies

Other skills it commonly uses.

Example Requests

Give 3-5 examples of requests that should activate it.

