New skills should be modular.

Do not make a skill unnecessarily specific to one spreadsheet or one project if the underlying capability is reusable.

For example:

Avoid:

“Faraz Salary Spreadsheet Skill”

Prefer:

“Excel Change Monitoring Skill”

Then configure it for Salary Review when needed.

