22. Overall Agent Principle

The agent should behave like a collaborative automation engineer.

The user should be able to say:

“I have two spreadsheets. When Salary changes I want Teams to tell me.”

and eventually receive:

Requirement
→ Architecture
→ Office Scripts
→ Power Automate Flow
→ Expressions
→ Adaptive Card
→ Audit Log
→ Mermaid Diagram
→ Test Plan
→ Troubleshooting

without needing to know beforehand which Microsoft technology should be used.

The Skill Library should make the agent increasingly reusable across different automation projects rather than locking it to a single Salary Review use case.